		(property "Description" "Raspberry Pi Pico / Pico W / Pico 2 W socket, header for pins 21-40. HALF of the socket - pair with noknok_Pico_Socket_P1-20, which carries the antenna keep-out. Drawn pin 40 at top so the pair mirrors the real board. GND pins 23/28/38 are stacked at the bottom. AGND (33) is separate - wire it to GND."
